Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:59:56 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] relay: speak a conversation's newest message when it is
 opened

Adds an opt-in switch, 'Speak conversations when opened'. Opening a
conversation from the inbox speaks its newest message over the tts
capability, so a message or voice-note transcript missed on the band can
be heard again by reopening it. Tap still replies and stops the voice
before the microphone opens; Back stops it and returns to the list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JrecJaswUTk7nYaLedQ14R
